{"id":"2045441652676981719","kind":"article","title":"脆弱的目的","author":"Rob Bensinger","original_authors":["Rob Bensinger"],"original_source_urls":["https://www.readthesequences.com/Fragile-Purposes-Sequence"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"理性 & 克服偏见","date":"2026-06-03","updated":"2026-07-22","votes":19,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":331,"keywords":["目标导向系统","心智","进化","人工智能","理性"],"summary":"Rob Bensinger 介绍《脆弱的目的》系列从人类认知与进化抽象考察心智和目标导向系统，并说明它也展示作者受 AI 研究影响的哲学与理性研究方法；页面随后列出相关章节。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2045441652676981719","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"cpb_4Faz\">……<span class=\"nolink\">《脆弱的目的》</span>从人类认知与进化中抽象出来，探讨最一般意义下的心智与目标导向系统。这些文章也承载着第二重目的：解释作者研究哲学与理性科学的总体方法——这一方法深受其在人工智能领域工作的影响。</p><p data-pid=\"AM6m_3xk\">—Rob Bensinger, <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.readthesequences.com/Minds-An-Introduction\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Minds: An Introduction</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup></p><hr/><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-bfc509c83505b14f250a80135639092f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" data-draft-title=\"对智能的信念\" data-tm-id=\"2035044297796489739\" href=\"#/post/2035044297796489739\">对智能的信念</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-db5cbe5ea0e08bdcd5debb6b4de385a8.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" data-draft-title=\"穿着滑稽戏服的人类\" data-tm-id=\"2035445062407025237\" href=\"#/post/2035445062407025237\">穿着滑稽戏服的人类</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-424ec698100bc4f82ea5902d063998d4.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" data-draft-title=\"优化与智能爆炸\" data-tm-id=\"2038964086780711155\" href=\"#/post/2038964086780711155\">优化与智能爆炸</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-bfaae84cb26591e80c9e08f54626242f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" data-draft-tit